# ── Intentionally omitted from this public release ──────────────────────────
# The following existed in the private development repository and were
# deliberately left out of this public archive. They are listed here so the
# omission is visible and explicit.
#
#   .env                          API credentials
#   notes/                        internal planning and design-decision notes
#   eval/api-logs/                raw API request/response logs
#   eval/part2/logs/              pilot and smoke-test logs
#   eval/part2/runs/              raw inference store (published copies are in results/)
#   eval/out/                     duplicate of results/part1
#   ui/                           internal visualization server
#   .private/                     unredacted backups of redacted published files
#   eval/part2/cost_estimate.py   internal budget-planning script
#   eval/part2/dry_run.py         internal dry-run script
#   eval/part2/pilot_run.py       pilot infrastructure
#   eval/part2/pilot_sample.py    pilot sampling script
#   eval/part2/batch_smoke_test.py  smoke-test script
#   eval/part2/mock_responses.py  mock-response fixtures
#   eval/part2/runner.py          mock/live cell orchestration loop
#   eval/part2/live_json_prompt_check.py  debugging script
#
# Each of the above has an enforcing rule below, so restoring one locally will
# not silently add it to a commit.

# ── Intentionally-omitted paths (enforced, not just documented) ─────────────
notes/
ui/
.private/
eval/api-logs/
eval/out/
eval/part2/logs/
eval/part2/runs/
eval/part2/cost_estimate.py
eval/part2/dry_run.py
eval/part2/pilot_run.py
eval/part2/pilot_sample.py
eval/part2/batch_smoke_test.py
eval/part2/mock_responses.py
eval/part2/runner.py
eval/part2/live_json_prompt_check.py

# ── Standard ignores (keep local runs from dirtying the tree) ───────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.env
.env.*
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.DS_Store

# Hugging Face tokenizer cache. eval/part1/token_stats.py sets HF_HOME here, so
# a first Part 1 run downloads tokenizer weights into this directory.
eval/.hf_cache/
